# Components

- One responsibility per file; reusable over one-offs
- Named exports; default only for route `page` / `layout`
- Sections compose; animations isolate motion; UI stays primitive

| Kind | Pattern | Example |
|------|---------|---------|
| Primitive | Noun | `Button` |
| Layout | `Site` + role | `SiteHeader` |
| Section | Domain + purpose | `HeroCinematic` |
| Island | Verb + concern | `HeroIntroTimeline` |
| Hook | `use` + concern | `useInViewGate` |

- Prefer extracting a client leaf so parents stay Server Components
- No duplicated timeline logic across sections — share islands
